## ✅ **Concepts Covered**

| Concept       | Demonstrated In                |
| ------------- | ------------------------------ |
| Encapsulation | Employee.java                  |
| Inheritance   | Designation.java, Manager.java |
| Abstraction   | Salary.java                    |
| Interface     | Role.java                      |
| Polymorphism  | MainApp.java                   |
| Static        | Company.java                   |
| Final         | Company.java                   |
| Super         | Designation.java               |
| This          | Employee.java                  |

